No third-party software is bundled in this package. It has no runtime
dependencies: the host-side modules use only the Node.js standard library, and
`scripts/build.mjs` copies `src/` to `lib/` without a bundler.

The device-registry, pairing, credential and connection-admission design was
written for this package after reading the public documentation and source of
four community remote-access projects. No file, dependency or runtime asset from
any of them is included here.
